### Quick API tests (install the "REST Client" VS Code extension, click "Send Request")
@base = http://localhost:3001/api

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Vehicles available for a date range
GET {{base}}/vehicles?start=2030-01-10&end=2030-01-12&available=true

### Create vehicle
POST {{base}}/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mahindra Thar", "plate": "PB10ZZ0001", "type": "car", "seats": 4, "dailyRate": 2800 }

### Book a vehicle
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehicleId": "v1", "customer": "Amrit Singh", "start": "2030-01-10", "end": "2030-01-12" }

### List bookings
GET {{base}}/bookings
